{
    "title": "PDF Editor: PDF Fill & Sign",
    "description": "<b>\ud83d\udcda PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign - versatile and power PDF editing app\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f</b>\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf7 Document Scanner: Powerful and Fast Scanner</b>\r\n\r\n<b>You are looking for an PDF expert application to help you:</b>\r\n\u2705 Scan photos, scan PDF, scan ID cards quickly\r\n\u2705 PDF reader, PDF opener and viewer\r\n\u2705 Ebook reader\r\n\u2705 PDF editor, document editor: easy to edit PDF files\r\n\u2705 PDF writer: Draw and write on PDF files\r\n\u2705 PDF fill and sign: sign documents PDF\r\n\u2705 Electronic signature maker\r\n\u2705 PDF Scanner: Convert photos to PDF\r\n\r\nCongrats, this PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign app is your perfect choice!. Not only a PDF reader PDF filler application, this is also a smart document editor tool to support your work and study. The document signer app integrates all powerful PDF editing features. Just select the PDF file, then open PDF and edit PDF however you want. All PDF edit signing operations are so easy and convenient!\r\n\r\n<b>Main features of the PDF signer app:</b>\r\n<b>\u2b50PDF scanner, document scanner</b>\r\n- Document scanning feature: scan photos, take pictures with precision, ensure high quality scanned documents. Scan tags, scan PDFs, scan documents quickly with a few simple taps and convert to PDF files, making it easy to share and store your files.\r\n- Convert images to PDF\r\n- Select images from the gallery or scan all kinds of documents with your camera and convert to PDF file.\r\n- Resize, crop and rotate images as you want. Quality optimization, scans for high quality PDF output\r\n\r\n<b>\u2b50 PDF editor, file editor</b>\r\n- PDF writer and editor: write on PDF files, write on documents\r\n- Multi PDF editing tools: bookmarks file, PDF notes, edit PDF text, add photos, PDF signature, certificates...\r\n- Fill PDF, save and submit PDF forms\r\n- Digital signature maker, signature creator app for scanner signature\r\n- Sign PDF: sign documents with your saved digital signature or you can simply draw a signature on the document\r\n\r\n<b>\u2b50 PDF reader, PDF viewer</b>\r\n- Open and quickly view PDF documents.\r\n- Show list of PDF files, easy PDF reader\r\n- Find PDF document with a simple search option.\r\n- Zoom in and out of PDF files.\r\n- Bookmark PDF for easy review\r\n- Scroll PDF documents page by page\r\n- Rename, bookmark file\r\n- Sign and fill PDF files, fill out PDF\r\n\r\n<b>\u2b50E- signature & Form filler</b>\r\n- Draw, or import your signature. E- sign documents using your finger or stylus.\r\n- Easily fill in PDF forms by editing the text directly on the document. Tap to enter text or checkmarks in form fields. Fill forms even faster with custom autofill entries.\r\n- Opening an interactive form, you can identify and fill out multiple form field components: Name, address, city, phone number, company.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2b50 Other features include in PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign app:</b>\r\n- Refresh list\r\n- Quick page navigation\r\n- Read e-books, comics\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda The PDF file editor application helps to streamline the paperwork process and improve your work productivity. Signing electronic contracts and agreements will become easier than ever. You just need to create a PDF signature then submit the PDF form, send documents through other applications. It's easy to edit file PDF, edit documents. Hope the document filler application will be useful to you, start your work with this PDF editor and signer application now.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 We are always trying to improve the powerful PDF editor app. The document editing app is still in development so we welcome your feedback. If you have any questions about the e- sign documents app, don't hesitate to contact support email: trustedapp.support@apero.vn.\r\n\r\n<b>Thank you. Have a nice day \u2764\ufe0f</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>\ud83d\udcda PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign - versatile and power PDF editing app\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f</b><br><b>\ud83d\udcf7 Document Scanner: Powerful and Fast Scanner</b><br><br><b>You are looking for an PDF expert application to help you:</b><br>\u2705 Scan photos, scan PDF, scan ID cards quickly<br>\u2705 PDF reader, PDF opener and viewer<br>\u2705 Ebook reader<br>\u2705 PDF editor, document editor: easy to edit PDF files<br>\u2705 PDF writer: Draw and write on PDF files<br>\u2705 PDF fill and sign: sign documents PDF<br>\u2705 Electronic signature maker<br>\u2705 PDF Scanner: Convert photos to PDF<br><br>Congrats, this PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign app is your perfect choice!. Not only a PDF reader PDF filler application, this is also a smart document editor tool to support your work and study. The document signer app integrates all powerful PDF editing features. Just select the PDF file, then open PDF and edit PDF however you want. All PDF edit signing operations are so easy and convenient!<br><br><b>Main features of the PDF signer app:</b><br><b>\u2b50PDF scanner, document scanner</b><br>- Document scanning feature: scan photos, take pictures with precision, ensure high quality scanned documents. Scan tags, scan PDFs, scan documents quickly with a few simple taps and convert to PDF files, making it easy to share and store your files.<br>- Convert images to PDF<br>- Select images from the gallery or scan all kinds of documents with your camera and convert to PDF file.<br>- Resize, crop and rotate images as you want. Quality optimization, scans for high quality PDF output<br><br><b>\u2b50 PDF editor, file editor</b><br>- PDF writer and editor: write on PDF files, write on documents<br>- Multi PDF editing tools: bookmarks file, PDF notes, edit PDF text, add photos, PDF signature, certificates...<br>- Fill PDF, save and submit PDF forms<br>- Digital signature maker, signature creator app for scanner signature<br>- Sign PDF: sign documents with your saved digital signature or you can simply draw a signature on the document<br><br><b>\u2b50 PDF reader, PDF viewer</b><br>- Open and quickly view PDF documents.<br>- Show list of PDF files, easy PDF reader<br>- Find PDF document with a simple search option.<br>- Zoom in and out of PDF files.<br>- Bookmark PDF for easy review<br>- Scroll PDF documents page by page<br>- Rename, bookmark file<br>- Sign and fill PDF files, fill out PDF<br><br><b>\u2b50E- signature &amp; Form filler</b><br>- Draw, or import your signature. E- sign documents using your finger or stylus.<br>- Easily fill in PDF forms by editing the text directly on the document. Tap to enter text or checkmarks in form fields. Fill forms even faster with custom autofill entries.<br>- Opening an interactive form, you can identify and fill out multiple form field components: Name, address, city, phone number, company.<br><br><b>\u2b50 Other features include in PDF Editor: PDF Fill And Sign app:</b><br>- Refresh list<br>- Quick page navigation<br>- Read e-books, comics<br><br>\ud83d\udcda The PDF file editor application helps to streamline the paperwork process and improve your work productivity. Signing electronic contracts and agreements will become easier than ever. You just need to create a PDF signature then submit the PDF form, send documents through other applications. It&#39;s easy to edit file PDF, edit documents. Hope the document filler application will be useful to you, start your work with this PDF editor and signer application now.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 We are always trying to improve the powerful PDF editor app. The document editing app is still in development so we welcome your feedback. If you have any questions about the e- sign documents app, don&#39;t hesitate to contact support email: trustedapp.support@apero.vn.<br><br><b>Thank you. Have a nice day \u2764\ufe0f</b>",
